26
00:03:29,539 --> 00:03:33,355
[Host] It means public, run by the city or prefecture.

27
00:03:33,955 --> 00:03:39,860
[Slow] しかし、今年の県民の日は土曜日です。

28
00:03:40,659 --> 00:03:43,972
